msgid "Linked Lists"
msgstr "链表"

msgid "In this chapter, we discuss linked lists in object-oriented programming. We see the need for a copy constructor, destructor, and assignment operator."
msgstr "在本章中，我们讨论面向对象编程中的链表。我们会看到为什么需要拷贝构造函数、析构函数和赋值运算符。"

